<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  The AoC 2026 nightly run (nightly.py), at 02:00 local time on a Mac set to Pacific time:
  five hours after each puzzle's release. Outside the event it prints "No AoC 2026 puzzle is
  open tonight." to launchd.out and exits. caffeinate keeps the Mac awake while it runs.

  Posting is switched in .env, not here: SUBMIT_SOLUTIONS=true posts, and false or unset
  (config/resources.yaml, `submission: enabled: false`) runs the trials and posts nothing.
  Only the submission step reads it, and that step runs only for a named account. Set it to
  true before 2026-12-01; the session cookie stays in .env as AOC_SESSION_EXPERIMENT.

  Install, from the checkout (REPO_DIR becomes its absolute path):
    sed "s|REPO_DIR|$PWD|g" scripts/com.problem-solver.nightly.plist > ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.problem-solver.nightly.plist
    launchctl bootstrap gui/$(id -u) ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.problem-solver.nightly.plist
    launchctl print gui/$(id -u)/com.problem-solver.nightly | grep -E "state|path"
  Wake the Mac before it runs (needs an administrator; replaces any other repeating wake):
    sudo pmset repeat wakeorpoweron MTWRFSU 01:50:00
    pmset -g sched

  It runs only in a logged-in session: a LaunchAgent, and Ollama's app, start at login. With
  FileVault on, a Mac that shut down or restarted waits at the unlock screen and misses the
  night, so through the event stay logged in, leave the Mac on (sleep is fine) and turn off
  automatic restarts for macOS updates.

  Test night: install a copy with another Label, the hour and minute to test, and nightly.py's
  options for 2024 day 2 added to ProgramArguments (year 2024, from-day 2, day 2; see
  nightly.py -h); set the wake a few minutes before it; put the Mac to sleep; next morning read
  accounts/experiment/nightly/2024/. Then remove the copy.

  After the event:
    launchctl bootout gui/$(id -u)/com.problem-solver.nightly
    rm ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.problem-solver.nightly.plist
    sudo pmset repeat cancel
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.problem-solver.nightly</string>
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/usr/bin/caffeinate</string>
    <string>-i</string>
    <string>REPO_DIR/venv/bin/python</string>
    <string>REPO_DIR/nightly.py</string>
  </array>
  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>REPO_DIR</string>
  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>AOC_ACCOUNT</key>
    <string>experiment</string>
    <key>DENY_NETWORK</key>
    <string>true</string>
  </dict>
  <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
  <dict>
    <key>Hour</key>
    <integer>2</integer>
    <key>Minute</key>
    <integer>0</integer>
  </dict>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>REPO_DIR/accounts/experiment/nightly/launchd.out</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>REPO_DIR/accounts/experiment/nightly/launchd.err</string>
</dict>
</plist>
